config RAK_REGOUT0_FIX
	bool "Program UICR REGOUT0 to 3.3 V on a VDDH-powered RAK4630"
	depends on BOARD_RAK4631_NRF52840
	help
	  Early-boot hook for the RAK4630 module, whose nRF52840 is supplied
	  through VDDH. A full chip erase leaves UICR REGOUT0 at its 1.8 V
	  default, which underpowers the LEDs and 3.3 V peripherals. The hook
	  programs REGOUT0 to 3.3 V once and resets the chip. It is a no-op
	  when the chip runs in normal-voltage mode or REGOUT0 is already set.
